  "title": "Greek Souzoukaklia",
  "description": "Flavorful beef skewers, made with ground beef, onions, and raisins, and seasoned with cayenne pepper, cinnamon, coriander, and nutmeg. Mix together the ingredients while the grill is heating up, and this dish can be on the table within 45 minutes.",
